## Topology 6 — Conditional Branch: Success Path Only

`validate_input` branches on HTTP status. If it succeeds (2xx), `process_data` runs. If it fails (non-2xx), no downstream task runs — DAG goes directly to `finalize_results`.

> **Runtime limitation:** this passes build validation, but selecting the empty failure side makes `choose_branch` raise `AirflowException`.

```
validate_input
    |
    +-- 2xx  --> process_data --> finalize_results
    |
    +-- non-2xx --> (nothing) --> finalize_results
```

