## Topology 10 — Orphan Node

`submit_audit` is in layer 1 alongside `validate_source`, but it has no downstream children and is not in the final layer. The generator auto-wires it directly to `finalize_results`.

```
run_started_event
    |
    +--> validate_source (order=1, seq=1, branch)
    |         +-- success --> process_data ---------------> finalize_results
