## Topology 15 — Conditional Branch into Three Nodes, then Merge

Use this topology when one decision node must start three tasks in parallel on success, use a separate recovery task on failure, and then continue through one merge node.

```
decision
    |
    +-- success --> branch_a --+
    +-- success --> branch_b --+--> merge_results --> finalize_results
    +-- success --> branch_c --+
    |
    +-- failure --> handle_failure --> merge_results
```

